   "y": -1450,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "35 KDA attn **2.21B** (43.2%) · 7 MLA attn **223.8M** (4.4%) · dense FFN ×2 **94.4M** (1.8%) · routed experts 40×512 **1.89B** (37.0%) · shared experts + routers **288.4M** (5.7%) · lm head **402.4M** (7.9%) · embed **0** (row lookup) · ViT + projector **0** (runs per image) · norms **0.2M** (0.0%)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1300,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "# Ling-3.0-flash-VL — model  \nRead top → bottom. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all the same size; where parameters and compute live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length, P = image patches. *Layer* tab = one decoder layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1300,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "Layer rows — **KDA** (Kimi Delta Attention, linear): fixed-size state [32, 128, 128] per sequence, no KV cache, no position encoding · **Gated MLA**: softmax attention over a compressed KV cache (512 + 64 values per token), M-RoPE, per-head sigmoid output gate. Pattern repeats every 6 layers: 5 KDA → 1 MLA (35 : 7).    \nFFN — L0–1 dense SwiGLU 6144; L2–41 MoE: 512 experts × 768, top-8 (sigmoid scores, 8 groups → best 4) + 1 shared expert. No MTP head in this checkpoint."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-src",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1080,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "Sources: tensor shapes from the safetensors headers of inclusionAI/Ling-3.0-flash-VL, hyper-parameters from its config.json, dataflow from inclusionAI/vllm-ling-v3 (bailing_moe_v3.py, bailing_moe_v3_vl.py); total / active counts from the model card (124B / 5.5B)."
  },
