  },
  {
   "id": "note-vision",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -204,
   "width": 700,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "Vision tower = Qwen3-VL-style ViT (27 pre-LN blocks, width 1152). The merger has no MLP of its own (config `disable_merger_proj`; its `out_hidden_size` 4096 is unused) — the 2-layer projector does the alignment. No DeepStack taps: the checkpoint has no deepstack_merger weights and vLLM disables them."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-mrope",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -24,
   "width": 700,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "M-RoPE: text tokens get (t, h, w) = (n, n, n); image tokens get their grid cell. The 32 rotary frequencies are split 8/12/12 over t/h/w (θ = 6e+06). Only the 7 MLA layers use positions; KDA layers are position-free."
  },
