  {
   "id": "note-layer",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 620,
   "y": -128,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 330,
   "text": "Every layer: RMSNorm → attention → add → RMSNorm → FFN → add (pre-norm, fused residual).    \nKDA layer ≈ **63.0M** attention; MLA layer ≈ **32.0M**. MoE layer ≈ **3.03B**, of which one token multiplies ≈ 54.4M (8 routed + 1 shared expert + router).    \nSwiGLU clamp (config): routed experts limit 4 in L35–41; shared expert limit 5/7 in L34–41.    \nContext: 128K native, 256K with YaRN ×2 (model card serving recipe)."
  },
  {
